# Model Preferences

This file is a starting point for private OpenCode model preferences. Copy it
to `${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/engineering-skillset/model-preferences.md`
and edit it for your configured providers. Check `opencode models` and use the
model names shown for each provider. Names and availability vary by OpenCode
configuration.

Preferences are advisory. Ordering applies within each provider; provider order
does not rank providers globally. The agent may choose another available
model when it better fits the task and should report the selected model and
reason. Unavailable preferences are skipped.

```yaml
preferred_models:
  openai:
    - gpt-6-luna
    - gpt-6.1-terra
    - gpt-6-sol
  deepseek:
    - deepseek-flash
  lan-ollama:
    - qwen3-coder:30b
```
